# macOS only. Personal Linux machines also run this Brewfile (ADR-0017), so
# everything below is either macOS-only upstream (xcodes, xcodegen, tart,
# fastlane's Xcode tooling, every cask) or has a different owner on Linux:
# Docker from Docker's apt repo (ADR-0018), powershell from Microsoft's apt
# repo, nvm from its install script (dotfiles#435).
tap "openai/tools"
tap "terraform-linters/tap"

# Docker without Docker Desktop (ADR-0018): Colima runs the engine in a
# headless VM; the CLI plugins are wired up by ~/.docker/config.json.
